stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> created : kpay.createPayment

    created --> processed : customer approves in Kinesis app<br/>(funds move customer → merchant)
    created --> rejected  : customer declines in Kinesis app
    created --> expired   : 10-minute timeout

    processed --> [*]
    rejected  --> [*]
    expired   --> [*]

    note right of created
        QR code displayed.
        Adapter polls every 10s.
    end note

    note right of processed
        Terminal success.
        Adapter then:
        - kpay.confirmPayment (attaches Stripe PI id)
        - stripe.paymentIntents.update (metadata)
        - stripe.paymentRecords.reportPayment
    end note

    note right of expired
        Adapter cancels the
        Stripe PaymentIntent.
    end note
